hpc:Job a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Resource .

hpc:Jobs a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Resource ;
    rdfs:comment "Collection of jobs." .

# Job resource properties
hpc:jobId a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

# Jobs resource properties
hpc:jobsResponseSchema a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Jobs ;
    rdfs:range #v0.0.42_openapi_slurmdbd_jobs_resp .
```

This ontology fragment represents the `Job` and `Jobs` resources, as well as their respective properties. The `jobId` property is a datatype property of the `Job` resource, while the `jobsResponseSchema` property is an object property of the `Jobs` resource. The range of the `jobsResponseSchema` property is a schema defined elsewhere, indicated by the `#v0.0.42_openapi_slurmdbd_jobs_resp` IRI.
